EmitBranchModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Emission of the Branch term plus recursive lowering of True/False branches into new blocks (via EmitChild).
    Provides: EmitBranch(node, blocks, openIdx, counter) -> res.
    DependsOn: EmitChild, NewOpen, FindChild, EmitSeq (via merged namespace)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../EmitBranch/EmitBranch.sir).
